Description: transactional DNS management toolkit for BIND 9
 ZoneCTL provides guarded CLI and TUI workflows for BIND DNS zones, records,
 lifecycle operations and DNSSEC management. Mutating operations use plans,
 validation, backups, explicit confirmation and rollback.
